Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.08,0:00:01.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tenta acertar antes de mim.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mito.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.23,0:00:05.05,Cap,,0,0,0,,É comum.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.13,0:00:05.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mas não é obrigatório
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.98,0:00:06.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,para o diagnóstico.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.83,0:00:07.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,Quem não se machuca
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.77,0:00:09.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,também pode estar sofrendo muito.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.48,0:00:14.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mito. Pode, mas com cuidado.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Esse padrão precisa durar
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,um tempo.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.38,0:00:17.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,Aparecer em várias áreas
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.97,0:00:20.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,da vida, prejudicar suas funções.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.23,0:00:21.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Então não pode ser
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.56,0:00:22.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,só uma fase.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.63,0:00:26.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Verdade. E muitas vezes deve.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.88,0:00:28.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,Quem convive também tem
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,que saber reagir e
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.23,0:00:29.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,se cuidar.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.88,0:00:33.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Mito.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Muita gente consegue.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,Claro, costuma pedir mais
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.27,0:00:38.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,conversa, mais combinado, previsão.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.58,0:00:39.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,E muitas vezes o tratamento.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.93,0:00:40.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,E você, em qual
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.83,0:00:42.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,dessas você ouvia como verdade?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.78,0:00:43.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Comenta aqui o número.
